          <h2><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"/><path d="M12 8v4M12 16h.01" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg> Policy Summary</h2>
          <p>
            All purchases on FileMakr are for <strong>downloadable digital content</strong> (project reports,
            documentation, diagram packs, source code). Once delivered or downloaded, orders are
            <strong>non-refundable</strong>.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section id="digital" class="lp-section">
          <h2><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8l-6-6z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"/></svg> Digital Goods — All Sales Are Final</h2>
          <ul class="lp-list">
            <li><strong>No returns / cancellations:</strong> Because files are instantly accessible after purchase, we do not accept returns or cancellations.</li>
            <li><strong>Academic use only:</strong> Items are licensed strictly for personal academic/educational use and may not be resold or redistributed.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section id="exceptions" class="lp-section">
          <h2><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M10.29 3.86 1.82 18a2 2 0 0 0 1.71 3h16.94a2 2 0 0 0 1.71-3L13.71 3.86a2 2 0 0 0-3.42 0zM12 9v4M12 17h.01" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg> Exceptions We’ll Fix</h2>
          <p>While refunds aren’t offered, we’ll promptly resolve the following:</p>
          <ul class="lp-list">
            <li><strong>Corrupted or incomplete file:</strong> We’ll provide a working replacement download.</li>
            <li><strong>Access issues:</strong> If a link fails or expires prematurely, we’ll re-issue access.</li>
            <li><strong>Duplicate charge:</strong> If you were charged twice for the same order, we’ll reverse the duplicate after verification.</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="lp-mini">To report an issue, see <a href="#contact">Contact</a> below with your order details (email, phone, transaction ID).</p>
        </section>

        <section id="setup" class="lp-section">
          <h2><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 0 0 1.4 0l3.77-3.77a6 6 0 0 1-7.94 7.94l-6.91 6.91a2.12 2.12 0 0 1-3-3l6.91-6.91a6 6 0 0 1 7.94-7.94l-3.76 3.76z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"/></svg> Code Setup Support (Optional Add-On)</h2>
          <ul class="lp-list">
            <li><strong>Delivery window:</strong> Our team typically initiates setup within <strong>24 hours</strong> of purchase.</li>
            <li><strong>Scope:</strong> Installation, environment configuration, and running the project as provided. Custom features are not included.</li>
            <li><strong>Non-refundable service:</strong> As expert time is allocated on booking, setup support fees are non-refundable once scheduled.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section id="delivery" class="lp-section">
          <h2><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"/><path d="M12 7v5l3 2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg> Delivery &amp; Access</h2>
          <ul class="lp-list">
            <li><strong>Instant downloads:</strong> Most products are available immediately after payment.</li>
            <li><strong>Link expiry:</strong> For security, some links may expire; please store files safely once downloaded.</li>
            <li><strong>File formats:</strong> Reports may include DOC/PDF; source code includes folders, README, and sample data where applicable.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section id="coupons" class="lp-section">
